7p1"><span>智能搜索素材</span></div><p>精准识别并快速定位素材</p></div></div></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="yKEZ2M"><h2 class="JisT_8">专业剪辑 轻松剪出大片</h2><div class="jR3CJF"><div class="rTFiPg"><ul class="tWASPX"><li class="ERfozH GgwrLc"><span>蒙版</span><p class="XY4cWx">支持添加线性、圆形、文字、钢笔等多种形式，轻松实现创意转场、惊喜抠像、局部特效。</p></li><li class="ERfozH"><span>关键帧</span><p class="XY4cWx">只需设置起点和终点，即可自动生成流畅过渡。无论是移动、缩放还是淡入淡出，关键帧让视频创作更自由、更专业！</p></li><li class="ERfozH"><span>调色</span><p class="XY4cWx">支持色轮、HSL、色相饱和度曲线、浮点调色、RGB曲线，轻松实现各种色彩效果。</p></li><li class="ERfozH"><span>多机位</span><p class="XY4cWx">通过自动、声音方式精准对齐，可在4机位或9机位模式下，轻松实现多角度流畅切换。</p></li><li class="ERfozH"><span>多时间线</span><p class="XY4cWx">在一个草稿里创建多条时间线，新增上限可达50条，便于分区剪辑。</p></li><li class="ERfozH"><span>音频剪辑</span><p class="XY4cWx">支持升降调、声音分离、立体声平衡、音频创作布局等能力，让你的创作声临其境，玩转声音创意。</p></li></ul></div><div class="kBlBJT"><picture class="astra-img XrRZHS"><source srcSet="https://p16-seeyou-sg.ibyteimg.com/tos-alisg-i-2zwwjm3azk-sg/103ba53a1feb6150655a8928356f448e.png~tplv-2zwwjm3azk-image.webp" type="image/webp"/><img draggable="false" crossorigin="anonymous" alt="mask" loading="lazy" fetchPriority="low" src="https://p16-seeyou-sg.ibyteimg.com/tos-alisg-i-2zwwjm3azk-sg/103ba53a1feb6150655a8928356f448e.png~tplv-2zwwjm3azk-image.image"/></picture><p class="caNKGP">支持添加线性、圆形、文字、钢笔等多种形式，轻松实现创意转场、惊喜抠像、局部特效。</p></div></div></section><section class="mApZS7"><h2 class="GzXqYu">全能易用 服务各类创作场景</h2><div class="byISFr"><ul class="lnsBr8"><li class="QyW7__"><picture class="astra-img"><img draggable="false" crossorigin="anonymous" alt="media-broadcast" loading="lazy" fetchPriority="low" src="https://p16-seeyou-sg.ibyteimg.com/tos-alisg-i-2zwwjm3azk-sg/f285baff7d46fac5d520ec7549ad57f2.png~tplv-2zwwjm3azk-image.awebp"/></picture><div class="sfEfsX"><span class="W5UXkk">自媒体口播</span><p class="T0JupL">美颜美体、智能剪口播、人声美化、智能抠像</p></div></li><li class="QyW7__"><picture class="astra-img"><source srcSet="https://p16-seeyou-sg.ibyteimg.com/tos-alisg-i-2zwwjm3azk-sg/ddbc21d6794a268d5f8620d519dec6eb.png~tplv-2zwwjm3azk-image.webp" type="image/webp"/><img draggable="false" crossorigin="anonymous" alt="video-editing" loading="lazy" fetchPriority="low" src="https://p16-seeyou-sg.ibyteimg.com/tos-alisg-i-2zwwjm3azk-sg/ddbc21d6794a268d5f8620d519dec6eb.png~tplv-2zwwjm3azk-image.image"/></picture><div class="sfEfsX"><span class="W5UXkk">影视综二创</span><p class="T0JupL">智能镜头分割、人声分离、文本朗读、AI音乐</p></div></li><li class="QyW7__"><picture class="astra-img"><source srcSet="https://p16-seeyou-sg.ibyteimg.com/tos-alisg-i-2zwwjm3azk-sg/826aea1ba876d27a333821349a85a700.png~tplv-2zwwjm3azk-image.webp" type="image/webp"/><img draggable="false" crossorigin="anonymous" alt="marketing-promotion" loading="lazy" fetchPriority="low" src="https://p16-seeyou-sg.ibyteimg.com/tos-alisg-i-2zwwjm3azk-sg/826aea1ba876d27a333821349a85a700.png~tplv-2zwwjm3azk-image.image"/></picture><div class="sfEfsX"><span class="W5UXkk">政企宣传</span><p class="T0JupL">音色克隆、AI音乐、数字人、模板</p></div></li><li class="QyW7__"><picture class="astra-img"><source srcSet="https://p16-seeyou-sg.ibyteimg.com/tos-alisg-i-2zwwjm3azk-sg/dfaf8bcf5ba9c130eec0171b964034d7.png~tplv-2zwwjm3azk-image.webp" type="image/webp"/><img draggable="false" crossorigin="anonymous" alt="government-enterprise-promotion" loading="lazy" fetchPriority="low" src="https://p16-seeyou-sg.ibyteimg.com/tos-alisg-i-2zwwjm3azk-sg/dfaf8bcf5ba9c130eec0171b964034d7.png~tplv-2zwwjm3azk-image.image"/></picture><div class="sfEfsX"><span class="W5UXkk">营销推广</span><p class="T0JupL">数字人、智能包装、营销成片、智能文案</p></div></li><li class="QyW7__"><picture class="astra-img"><source srcSet="https://p16-seeyou-sg.ibyteimg.com/tos-alisg-i-2zwwjm3azk-sg/0323f7b6d2f5fc13be9cafe4ee2e94d6.png~tplv-2zwwjm3azk-image.webp" type="image/webp"/><img draggable="false" crossorigin="anonymous" alt="professional-editing" loading="lazy" fetchPriority="low" src="https://p16-seeyou-sg.ibyteimg.com/tos-alisg-i-2zwwjm3azk-sg/0323f7b6d2f5fc13be9cafe4ee2e94d6.png~tplv-2zwwjm3azk-image.image"/></picture><div class="sfEfsX"><span class="W5UXkk">专业剪辑</span><p class="T0JupL">钢笔蒙版、关键帧、多机位、音频剪辑</p></div></li></ul></div></section><section class="Qy3emz"><div class="Vkn25_"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="70" height="19" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 70 19" class="cdmsWM"><g fill="#E6E6E6" clip-path="url(#capcut-logo_svg__a)"><path d="M23.34 3.804V.164l-4.378 2.3v-.138C18.962.876 17.922 0 16.417 0H2.544C.957 0 0 .876 0 2.326v3.666l6.128 3.174L0 12.368v3.666c0 1.423.957 2.299 2.544 2.299h13.872c1.505 0 2.544-.876 2.544-2.299v-.191l4.378 2.326v-3.694L13.16 9.167l10.178-5.362zM9.63 10.972l7.525 3.94H2.079zm7.47-7.552-7.47 3.913L2.08 3.42h15.022M65.061 10.386v-7.26h1.458v7.26zm-3.988 0v-7.26h1.458v7.26zm5.833 7.945h3.096l-3.065-4.791h-3.095zM53.068 8.035v-4.91h1.457v4.91zm-2.53 9.285h6.547V1.012h-6.547zm2.53-2.113v-5.03h1.457v5.03zm-8.274-3.065h2.56V4.196h-2.56zM29.41 3.125h18.243V1.012h-4.018L44.437 0h-3.125l-.773 1.012H36.52L35.747 0h-3.125l.803 1.012h-4.017v2.113zm11.547 9.017h2.529V4.196h-2.53zm-8.6-5.238v-1.16h4.761v1.16zm-2.56 5.238h2.56V11.13h4.761v1.011h2.53V4.197h-9.852zm2.56-2.53v-1.16h4.761v1.16zm-1.787 8.72h2.857l1.131-3.065h9.553l-.714 3.064h2.887l1.22-5.177H29.41v2.113h2.261zm27.022 0h3.096l3.6-5.834h5.416v-2.113h-.595V1.012h-4.047V0h-2.53v1.012h-4.046v9.374h-.595V12.5h3.303l-3.6 5.833z"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="capcut-logo_svg__a"><path fill="#fff" d="M0 0h70v18.331H0z"></path></clipPath></defs></svg><span class="CTxRSy">用电脑端AI剪辑 <br class="M5nwzf"/>轻松呈现专业效果</span><div class="iruoFd"><div>推荐Windows 10及以上64位系统<!-- --> <a aria-label="view recommended configuration" href="https://www.capcut.cn/readme" target="_self">查看推荐配置<!-- -->&gt;&gt;</a></div><div>* 新增支持NVIDIA RTX 50系GPU硬件加速，支持4:2:2硬件编解码，三编码器导出速度提升1.5倍</div><a aria-label="ARM version download link" href="https://www.capcut.cn/download-guidance?download_url=https%3A%2F%2Flf3-package.vlabstatic.com%2Fobj%2Ffaceu-packages%2Finstaller%2Fjianying_jianyingpro_0_1.2